      [
        "Operator Snapshot",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      [
        "Moment for a Break\nIllustrator: 수줍(Sjoop)\nA mug of hot cocoa of flavors from Kjersch is definitely a great choice before hiking the next mountain or receiving the next SOS distress call.",
        "Snowy but Bright\nIllustrator: 一块二毛一斤\nLike the brightest drop of sun atop the frozen peaks, the very sight of her brings instant warmth to those trapped in precipitous snow. She will brave the frigid cold and bring them to survival.",
        "Carving Through the Snow\nIllustrator: LAL!ROLE\nThe girl trudged through the peaks and carved a path down the snowy slopes. She is always straightlining her way to save lives in distress."
      ]
    ]
